- Files created: src/features/documents/pages/DocumentArchivePage.tsx, DocumentArchiveRoute.tsx, components/DocumentDetailPanel.tsx; src/features/forms/components/DynamicFormRenderer.tsx, pages/FormSubmissionPage.tsx; src/components/auth/RequireRole.tsx; tests for each. Modified: src/routes.tsx, src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx.
- Deviations: Figma pixel values could not be read from the local spec, so spacing/colors use project-standard Tailwind tokens; exact pixel values should be reconciled against figma-docs-spec.md. Backend Convex functions were assumed to exist with the signatures described; if they differ, adjust the query/mutation argument shapes and rerun `npx convex codegen`.